      "sourceHash": "b32b5e9856681b2c",
      "translationZh": "作者：Stephanie Fong , Yiwen Jiang , Zimu Wang , Hongxi Yang , Yaling Shen , Hiu Weh Naomi Chow , Heung Ying Lai , Xiangyu Zhao , Qingyang Xu , Zhongxing Xu , Jiahe Liu , Guilherme C. Oliveira , Vincent Lee , Zongyuan Ge , Dominic Dwyer",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
